c=g.$2("Analyse des normes de diffusion TV (DVB-T/Satellite) et d\xe9veloppement d'un studio logiciel de traitement de signal.","Analysis of TV broadcasting standards (DVB-T/Satellite) and development of a signal processing software studio.")
e=g.$2("Ce projet double volet explore la cha\xeene compl\xe8te de transmission de l'information.\n\n1. Ing\xe9nierie des Transmissions : \xc9tude approfondie des infrastructures de diffusion num\xe9rique (DVB-T, Satellite), incluant le codage de canal, la modulation (QAM, QPSK) et le multiplexage OFDM pour assurer l'int\xe9grit\xe9 du signal.\n2. D\xe9veloppement Outil 'CodecPlayer' : Conception d'une application Python interactive (bas\xe9e sur GStreamer et IPyWidgets) permettant de manipuler des flux audio/vid\xe9o, de visualiser leur spectre fr\xe9quentiel et de comparer l'impact de la quantification et des codecs en temps r\xe9el.","This dual-faceted project explores the complete information transmission chain.\n\n1. Transmission Engineering: In-depth study of digital broadcasting infrastructures (DVB-T, Satellite), including channel coding, modulation (QAM, QPSK), and OFDM multiplexing to ensure signal integrity.\n2. 'CodecPlayer' Tool Development: Design of an interactive Python application (based on GStreamer and IPyWidgets) to manipulate audio/video streams, visualize their frequency spectrum, and compare the impact of quantization and codecs in real-time.")
